<details class="rules-drawer">
  <summary>Field manual</summary>
  <div class="rules-content">
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">01</span><h3>Play</h3>
      <p>Study the incoming crisis. You begin with three Orders and spend one per card. Only played tags protect you when the crisis strikes.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Act</h3>
      <p>Choose one: buy, survey and possibly colonize, research a technology, or purge. Surveyed worlds stay charted, so later attempts go directly to colonization.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Endure</h3>
      <p>Reveal a crisis, resolve it, then clean up. Supply does not bank. Reach 4 Colonies early or finish cycle 10 with at least 2.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="rules-warning">
      <b>Loss conditions</b>
      <p>Stability 0 ends the run. Fleet 5 ends it unless you have 2 Colonies and the Defense Grid.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</details>
